@startuml
title Digidoclocker System States


[*] --> RegisterCitizen : [initial state]

state "Register Citizen" as RegisterCitizen
state "Login Citizen" as LoginCitizen
state "Upload Documents" as UploadDocuments
state "View Profile" as ViewProfile
state "Apply for Certificate" as ApplyForCertificate
state "Request Certificate by Registrar" as RequestCertificateByRegistrar

RegisterCitizen : entry / register citizen details
RegisterCitizen : do / verify registration
RegisterCitizen --> LoginCitizen : [registration successful]

LoginCitizen : entry / login credentials
LoginCitizen : do / authenticate user
LoginCitizen --> UploadDocuments : [login successful]
LoginCitizen --> ViewProfile : [login successful]
LoginCitizen --> ApplyForCertificate : [login successful]

UploadDocuments : entry / upload documents
UploadDocuments : do / store uploaded documents
UploadDocuments --> LoginCitizen : [upload complete]

ViewProfile : entry / view profile details
ViewProfile : do / display user information
ViewProfile --> LoginCitizen : [view profile complete]

ApplyForCertificate : entry / apply for certificate
ApplyForCertificate : do / send request to issuer
ApplyForCertificate --> RequestCertificateByRegistrar : [request sent]
ApplyForCertificate --> LoginCitizen : [apply for certificate complete]

RequestCertificateByRegistrar : entry / request certificate
RequestCertificateByRegistrar : do / verify request
RequestCertificateByRegistrar --> LoginCitizen : [request verified]

LoginCitizen --> [*] : [session ended]


@enduml
